NoPreferred(BORROWED, +258)    expect 42 01 02   err=0  42 01 02 
Preferred(BORROWED, +2^64)     expect 49 01 00 .. err=0  49 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 
NoPreferred(TAG, +258)         expect c2 42 01 02 err=0  c2 42 01 02 
NoPreferred(BORROWED, -258)    expect 42 01 01   err=0  42 01 01 
OnlyPreferred: Preferred(TAG, +2^64)             err=0  c2 49 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 
OnlyPreferred: Preferred(TAG, -(2^64+2))         err=0  c3 49 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 
exit=0
